      <p><strong>Investigator:</strong> <span data-field="investigator_name">{{ investigator_name }}</span>, M.S., CPH</p>
      <p><strong>Purpose:</strong> We would like to ask you to participate in a research study. The objective of this survey is to determine possible causes for reasons affecting visitation to The Crosby Arboretum by residents in Pearl River County, Mississippi and nearby. The Crosby Arboretum is a non-profit, public garden focused on native plant conservation and education.</p>
      <p><strong>Procedures:</strong> If you decide to participate in the study, you will be asked to complete an online survey. You must be at least 18 years of age and a resident of Mississippi or Louisiana to participate in this research. The survey will ask you to respond to a series of questions regarding The Crosby Arboretum.</p>
